{
 "header": {
  "probe": "Q21",
  "question": "Q21: does Auto Pipette Offset in one mode also change the other mode's Pipette Offset (prior art: MIES re-reads it)? Distinct offsets are set through the API first, +10 mV in I-Clamp and then +5 mV in V-Clamp; then Auto in V-Clamp, and then Auto in I-Clamp, nothing attached. Both tabs' Pipette Offset, Holding and its checkbox are read before and after each Auto (an earlier run saw V-Clamp's Holding turned on at its old offset). The padlocks the Autos lock are clicked open at the end.",
  "time": "2026-10-23T13:47:49.530732-04:00",
  "setup": "amplifier on, a model cell on the headstage, its switch at CELL (--model-cell CELL)",
